<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") -%>

<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <header class="rounded-3xl bg-[#022E5A] p-8 text-white sm:p-12">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-200">NoteSphere · Terms</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-blue-100">These terms apply when you browse, create an account, share learning material, or make a voluntary contribution through NoteSphere.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-blue-200">Effective October 24, 2026</p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">About this project</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">NoteSphere is an educational project maintained by students that helps students find and share study resources. It is not a formal organization or registered charity. The site is provided for educational and informational use.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Accounts and respectful use</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">Provide accurate account information, keep your sign-in credentials private, and tell us if you suspect unauthorized access. Do not misuse the service, interfere with its operation, evade access controls, harass others, upload malware, spam users, or use content in a way that violates applicable law or another person’s rights.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Notes, links, and copyright</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">Only share material you created or have permission to share. You retain rights you hold in your submissions and grant NoteSphere permission to host, display, and distribute them as needed to operate the service. Notes may link to third-party file hosts; we do not control those sites or guarantee their availability, safety, accuracy, or continued access.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">If you believe content infringes your rights or should be removed, email <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline dark:text-blue-300" href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a> with the URL and an explanation. We may hide or remove content while reviewing a report.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Voluntary contributions</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">Contributions are optional and are intended to help with hosting and upkeep. They are not purchases, do not provide special access or benefits, and are not represented as charitable or tax-deductible donations. Razorpay processes payments under its own terms. Contact <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline dark:text-blue-300" href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a> about a payment concern or refund request; requests will be handled in accordance with applicable law and payment-provider rules.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Availability and moderation</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">We may update, limit, suspend, or discontinue any feature and may restrict accounts or remove content that violates these terms or threatens the service or its users. We aim to keep the library useful, but do not promise uninterrupted availability or that every resource is accurate or suitable for a particular course.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Disclaimers and liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">Use the site and third-party material at your discretion. To the extent permitted by applicable law, NoteSphere is provided without guarantees, and we are not responsible for indirect loss, third-party sites, or decisions made using user-submitted materials. Nothing in these terms limits rights or liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Changes and contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">We may revise these terms as the service changes. Continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms. Questions can be sent to <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline dark:text-blue-300" href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>. Read our <a href="/privacy" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline dark:text-blue-300">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/cookies" class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline dark:text-blue-300">Cookie Policy</a> for information about data and browser storage.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
